From: W132D maintainers <tech@wenziwanka.com>
Subject: [PATCH] RK3528 HDMI/display support for H96 Max

Locally maintained RK3528 HDMI/display support used by H96 Max on the native Linux stable tree.
Original changes by wenziwanka <tech@wenziwanka.com>.

Include common PC pixel clocks, the complete RK3528 PHY tuning table,
explicit Esmart line-buffer allocation and clock error handling. Reject
RGB modes beyond the sink TMDS limit or without required SCDC support.
YCbCr 4:2:0 and deep-color negotiation remain unsupported.

